==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Roasted Hearty Basses are a type of [[Roasted Food]], and they are the result of [[Hearty Bass]] that has made contact with [[Fire]] or a [[Scorching Climate]].<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> Occasionally, [[Blue Hinox]]es will drop Roasted Hearty Basses when they are killed. Roasted Hearty Basses are said to have crispy skin and just the right amount of fat content to create an exceptionally tasty meal.<ref name="Inventory"/> [[Link]] can restore three of [[Heart]]s to his [[Life Gauge]] by eating a Roasted Hearty Bass.

